      "message": "Renaming this will break flashrom and any other software which uses this interface.  Is it sufficient just to change the comment?\n\nShould it be ACTIVE_RW?  Because RO could be the active firmware in recovery mode.\n\nAlternately, rename it, but then down below,\n\n/* \u0027RW\u0027 is vague if there are multiple RW images; we mean the active one, so the old constant is deprecated */\n#define EC_FLASH_REGION_RW EC_FLASH_REGION_ACTIVE_RW",
